    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17332" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Αὔγουστος</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>Augustus,</i> used as an
				Adj., = Gr. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σεβαστός,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Paus.
			</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				3.11.4
			</span></i>, etc.:—hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Αὐγούστειος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				61.20
			</span></i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Αὐγουστεῖον</span></b> ,
				τό, <i>temple of Augustus,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				57.10
			</span></i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Αὐγούστεια</span></b> , τά, <i>festival of A.,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				3.129
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				14.739
			</span></i>:—<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Αὐγουστάλιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
				<i>Augustalis,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ Αὐγουστάλια</span>”
				<i>ludi Augustales,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					54.34
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-άλιος, ὁ,</span>
			<i>praefectus Augusti,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Lyd.
				<u>Mag.</u>
				2.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> the month
				<i>August,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Num.</u>
				19
			</span></i>.</div>
